  "len": 93,
  "en": "Celica: Okay, that's the end of that. Oh, right, I fall asleep in here pretty often, so {ctl:3C3E}{face:041CF0}I'd be happy if you'd be just a little careful from now on.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
